#. Description of the plugin
#: wm-modularscale.php
msgid ""
"Generates harmonious, responsive typography ratios and modular scales with a "
"visual live preview sandbox for non-technical users."
msgstr ""
"Loob harmoonilisi, kohanduvaid tüpograafilisi suhteid ja modulaarseid "
"skaalasid reaalajas eelvaatega."

