#: src/Gutenberg/Blocks/fluid-lead/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Paragraph with the fluid body font size, a maximum line length of 35–85 "
"characters (default 65) and pretty line wrapping."
msgstr ""
"Lõik sujuva põhiteksti suuruse, 35–85 märgi reapikkuse (vaikimisi 65) ja "
"ühtlase reamurdmisega."

